{
    "test_name": "MOB.721_AssetLookup_Readings_Empty",
    "details": {
        "name": "MOB.721_AssetLookup_Readings_Empty",
        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.721` **The Readings tab's empty state** on an asset with no readings.\n- `EventReadings.tsx`: outside a work order the fields come only from current readings, so\n  with none the panel reads **`No readings recorded for this asset.`**. `MOB.720` covers the tab WITH readings.\n- Fixture `\u26a1 Building 0000` \u2014 0 readings, no meters, used by no other test (not an AV job asset,\n  which `MOB.550` writes readings to).\n- \ud83d\uded1 **READ-ONLY**.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Asset Lookup",
            "Readings",
            "read-only"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "set_cookie": ""
        },
        "options": {
